# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Title #
#, no-wrap
msgid "Qiskit MCP Servers {#qiskit-mcp-servers}"
msgstr "Qiskit MCP servery {#qiskit-mcp-servers}"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Qiskit MCP Servers is a collection of [Model Context Protocol (MCP)](https://modelcontextprotocol.io/) servers that integrate quantum computing capabilities into AI systems. These servers enable AI assistants, large language models (LLMs), and agents to access IBM Quantum&reg; services and Qiskit libraries.\n"
msgstr "Qiskit MCP servery jsou kolekce serverů [Model Context Protocol (MCP)](https://modelcontextprotocol.io/), které integrují kvantové výpočetní schopnosti do AI systémů. Tyto servery umožňují AI asistentům, velkým jazykovým modelům (LLM) a agentům přistupovat ke službám IBM Quantum&reg; a knihovnám Qiskit.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Admonition type=\"note\">\n"
"This is an open-source project. For the most up-to-date information, detailed API coverage, and advanced configurations, refer to the [Qiskit MCP Servers GitHub repository](https://github.com/Qiskit/mcp-servers).\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"<Admonition type=\"note\">\n"
"Jedná se o open-source projekt. Nejaktuálnější informace, podrobné pokrytí API a pokročilé konfigurace najdeš v [repozitáři Qiskit MCP serverů na GitHubu](https://github.com/Qiskit/mcp-servers).\n"
"</Admonition>\n"

